      "value": "funny how you mention it. but you just need a proper avatar made for full body. non of these issues happens with any of the people i know using full body. if your viewpoint is wrong with FBT then your avatar is not made for FBT. if your head follows your arms if strechted. your avatar does not support FBT. and i can go on forever. majority of avatars are not correctly setup for FBT due to the fact that only a limited amount of people uses FBT.",
