      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yeah that's probably right. When my hips fly off, they also fly off in SteamVR. Not much the game can do to prevent that.\n\nThe head sinking is by far the most pressing issue. The cause appears to be that the fullbody IK component requires a \"head effector\" component, which doesn't guarantee that the head will meet the target. Switching to VR IK would be for the best.",
      "viewerReactions": null
